ment can be earned in the demo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T18:09:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706678854","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4878650-1846018067931072","game_id":"steam-4878650","kind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest demo: eight missions, boss swarms and the full map editor","summary":"What's new for Next Fest Three stars per mission — and a reason to come back for them Card picks at waves 3, 5 and 7, plus tower combos that trigger SYNERGY Boss waves now bring real swarms: escorts in packs, then reinforcements New impacts for every tower and orbital ability, new exit portals with light pillars Toodry is now properly dry: the lakes are cracked salt flats What's in the demo Campaign missions 1–8 on the planets Overgroan and Toodry, seven towers The full map editor with share cod","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T18:41:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931072","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4878650-1843481262697316","game_id":"steam-4878650","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo is out — and it's the whole campaign","summary":"The demo is live It's not a slice. The demo has the complete 16-mission campaign — every planet, every tower, every boss. Most demos give you two levels; this one gives you the whole story. Every map is a code The map editor is in there too. Draw paths, place water and obstacles, decide where towers can be built — then hit save and the whole map turns into a short block of text. Paste it into a chat, someone else pastes it into their editor, and they're playing exactly your map. No accounts, no ","occurre